    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f428e1107b5bb02f",
      "translationZh": "我使用 llama.cpp 测试了 Qwen3.8 Flash，测试范围从仅使用 CPU 到用满我的 RTX PRO 6000 的全部 96GB 显存。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "17a82429d6b62bd6",
      "translationZh": "仅使用 CPU 时，在 2K 提示词长度下达到了 8.34 tok/s",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8eb65ab557348fc5",
      "translationZh": "用满全部 96GB 显存时达到了 109.07 tok/s",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cd65c32f5cbdabdb",
      "translationZh": "在 245K 上下文长度下，显存从 24GB 增至 96GB 时，速度从 14.89 增至 21.61 tok/s",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d760d800cd9f40d0",
      "translationZh": "96GB 相比 24GB 的速度优势，从 2K 时的 2.80x 降至 245K 时的 1.45x",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a105d81d00227acf",
      "translationZh": "强制将 27.2 GiB 的 PLE 表放到 CUDA 上，使解码速度从 108.5 降至 1.95 tok/s",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8dca534e2488950f",
      "translationZh": "常驻 RAM 的加载方式，其预填充性能是 mmap 的 1.87x",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4087c03b74c49733",
      "translationZh": "非统一 KV 在并发数为 16 时，总输出速度达到了 92.0 tok/s",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ca40b357851c5713",
      "translationZh": "模型：unsloth/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-GGUF",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2a661dd904936a2a",
      "translationZh": "引擎：llama.cpp b10666，修订版本 4e97ac86e",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7f50906fa3dd8795",
      "translationZh": "Qwen3.8 合并：6c84c7d5d，PR #27742",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "60a5e98dd855df8f",
      "translationZh": "我为每种配置都启动了一个全新的服务器实例。我会等待之前分配的显存释放，并等待 GPU 冷却。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f8f2834f2b0ffcf9",
      "translationZh": "每次运行都保存了解析后的配置、服务器日志、输出、内存使用情况和 GPU 遥测数据。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b24b6846163290a1",
      "translationZh": "关于显存范围的重要说明",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "66934170caa72b9d",
      "translationZh": "每次 GPU 测试我都使用同一块 RTX PRO 6000。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e1874bc3226939f0",
      "translationZh": "一个辅助进程预先占用了 GPU 显存，因此 llama.cpp 看到的可用显存池更小。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a51ec0af0d1d2057",
      "translationZh": "这测试的是显存容量和 CPU 卸载。它并不模拟真实 8GB 或 24GB GPU 的计算能力或带宽。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5321924510b7053b",
      "translationZh": "8GB 的测试结果并不意味着每块 8GB 显卡都能达到相同的速度。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f61f3268afb73693",
      "translationZh": "以下所有数据均使用长度为 2,048 个 token 的提示词。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9b55b022dc2993a3",
      "translationZh": "可用显存 RAM 中的专家层 预填充 解码",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4c37eb38eae2debc",
      "translationZh": "所有 GPU 测试均使用同一块 RTX PRO 6000。这些限制模拟的是显存容量，而非更小显存 GPU 的性能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e534de4a62f2c284",
      "translationZh": "1. 模型在 CPU 上运行",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d3c93f0f82fccfb0",
      "translationZh": "在提示词长度为 2K 时，仅使用 CPU 的预填充速度达到 182.64 tok/s，解码速度达到 8.34 tok/s。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1e935a010cc4d9e7",
      "translationZh": "这足以支持交互式聊天。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b06088298cfa87b0",
      "translationZh": "MoE 设计有助于此，因为模型为每个 token 仅激活 6B 参数。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3b9bc7634a0fb3d9",
      "translationZh": "2. 长上下文下，不同 VRAM 档位的性能趋于接近",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0050ee7b4cf2ebe9",
      "translationZh": "在提示词长度为 2K 时，96GB 的速度是 24GB 的 2.796 倍。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "32ced055057b41a5",
      "translationZh": "在提示词长度为 245K 时，这一优势缩小至 1.451 倍。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "99e0747539082093",
      "translationZh": "提示词包含 245,760 个 token 时的解码速度：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dbf8285dca27a951",
      "translationZh": "在长上下文下，每种配置的速度都会下降。最快配置的大部分领先优势也会消失。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a17346b7a9671460",
      "translationZh": "48 层中只有 12 层保留持续增长的注意力缓存。其余 36 层使用 Gated DeltaNet。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c57b7838226ba91b",
      "translationZh": "这使上下文内存占用保持在相对较低的水平，但并不意味着长上下文解码没有开销。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b37a39b9dc39afb1",
      "translationZh": "3. 在此构建版本中，CUDA 上的 PLE 慢了 55.6 倍",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2513d904c7ebd09c",
      "translationZh": "该 GGUF 包含一个大小为 27.2 GiB 的逐层词元嵌入表。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7654a05feff0202f",
      "translationZh": "我测试了两种放置位置：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d4b08e6cf82ada8e",
      "translationZh": "系统 RAM：预填充 1,967.9 tok/s，解码 108.5 tok/s",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a778eb5390e77843",
      "translationZh": "GPU VRAM：预填充 575.7 tok/s，解码 1.95 tok/s",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "35f4c06563997cf7",
      "translationZh": "放置在 CUDA 上时，解码慢了 55.6 倍。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "46921eb66cddbda1",
      "translationZh": "我确认了张量已经移动，但并未确定速度下降的具体原因。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "72b13c13ee2e6998",
      "translationZh": "我按 A-B-B-A 的顺序重复了测试。顺序效应为 0.56%。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6234bb64805c3a80",
      "translationZh": "内存数据也证实了放置位置。当该表移至 CUDA 时，GPU 内存占用增加了约 27.5 GiB。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "34a57b0f3cac0500",
      "translationZh": "放置在 CPU 上时，每个解码 token 约需 9.2 ms。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e7d4a8fda035223d",
      "translationZh": "放置在 CUDA 上时，每个解码 token 约需 513 ms。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d541cae2afee6b02",
      "translationZh": "如此大的延迟无法仅用算术运算来解释。它看起来更像是同步或逐 token 传输造成的，但我尚未证实原因。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "06d6dbab55337eae",
      "translationZh": "我的结论仅限于这个构建版本：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8e4beffd4f36ec52",
      "translationZh": "在 llama.cpp b10666 中，per_layer_token_embd=CUDA0 将解码速度从 108.5 tok/s 降至 1.95 tok/s。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "97cb4fe0c6db57dd",
      "translationZh": "4. RAM 常驻加载带来了 1.87x 的预填充吞吐量",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4d81075dd2fcc8cb",
      "translationZh": "我在相同的 48GB 张量放置配置下，对比了 mmap 与 RAM 常驻加载。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f9a1c44614520949",
      "translationZh": "RAM 常驻：预填充 746.7 tok/s",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d87f5f79f231e4c6",
      "translationZh": "mmap 平均值：预填充 400.4 tok/s",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c99d91d12b95ea51",
      "translationZh": "解码速率比为 0.998，因此解码基本没有变化。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "899e19101a436fa6",
      "translationZh": "这意味着 llama.cpp 不使用文件映射。并不意味着模型没有被加载。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0146b69eefdaa000",
      "translationZh": "该模式需要足够的空闲系统 RAM。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "5d3b8fa9429dbff2",
      "translationZh": "5. KV 布局改变了并发能力",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "09a06c6c303eb51d",
      "translationZh": "我在并发请求数从 1 到 16 的情况下，测试了统一和非统一 KV 布局。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5870c24b65c8d8b5",
      "translationZh": "在只有一个请求时，两者的初始速度均为 59.0 tok/s。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8d0e928af6146041",
      "translationZh": "统一 KV：68.8 tok/s",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f724368e18b6d509",
      "translationZh": "非统一 KV：92.0 tok/s",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ba42889fe6394e51",
      "translationZh": "在高并发下，非统一 KV 提供了更多的总输出。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2cc0cd73d4838cbe",
      "translationZh": "每个单独的请求仍然变慢了。并发提高了服务器的总处理能力，但并没有让单个请求变得更快。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1127140fea8fafaa",
      "translationZh": "非统一 KV 还会将可用上下文分配到各个槽位，因此它并不总是合适的设置。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3be59e6f35d4ad7f",
      "translationZh": "我暂未列出的结果",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
