    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d09504849f948634",
      "translationZh": "附言：编辑过程中滥用了 AI",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4e80a9a872cd1903",
      "translationZh": "我的主要问题是关于 PLE CUDA 的结果。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9c8d950180d71a86",
      "translationZh": "有没有人在另一块 GPU 或更新的 llama.cpp 构建版本上，使用 per_layer_token_embd=CUDA0 复现了同样的速度下降？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9484cc3c33681f07",
      "translationZh": "我的另一个问题是关于在对话中保留此前的思考过程。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7d33a65c9ab8664f",
      "translationZh": "我运行了同样的五轮编程对话，分别在后续提示中保留或移除了此前的推理过程。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cfaf9a82a0f83ce5",
      "translationZh": "保留此前的推理过程后，需要重新计算的提示词元从 18,403 减少到 267，因为历史记录始终只追加内容。不过，第 5 轮的提示从 18,387 个词元增长到 63,223 个词元，而最终解码速度为 48.9 tok/s，而不是 65.5 tok/s。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f805422745e1f12a",
      "translationZh": "这次每个实验组都只运行了一次，temperature 为 1.0。两个实验组的起始速度也不同，分别为 110.2 和 96.0 tok/s，所以我目前还不相信 69 倍和 25% 这两个具体数字。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0087",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cc8d489889271549",
      "translationZh": "有人复现过这种权衡吗？保留此前的推理过程通常能省下这么多提示重新计算吗？更长的提示又会让解码速度降低多少？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0088",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "00dd6391416a3898",
      "translationZh": "或者，有没有其他能提高这个模型效率的发现？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0089",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4bb0d3d9d58d2edd",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/FantasticNature7590 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
